[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0010","text":"好——！\n甘奈们现在在游戏厅哦——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0020","text":"终、终于打到第一只……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0030","text":"千雪……开枪之后，要换弹……\n不能……松懈……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0040","text":"啊，对不起……！\n……这样就好了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0050","text":"嗯……感觉不错……！\n这次别忘了换弹——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0060","text":"呀……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0070","text":"呼…………轻松"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0080","text":"啊哈哈……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0090","text":"甘奈去换一下游戏币哦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0100","text":"……诶，甘——啊，走掉了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0110","text":"──甜花，对游戏很在行呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0120","text":"……啊，那个……\n怎么样呢……只是玩了很多……而已……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0130","text":"是吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0140","text":"不过，我今天因为有甜花的带领，\n感觉游戏好玩了好几倍呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0150","text":"以后还能教我各种游戏吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0160","text":"嗯、嗯……\n随时都可以……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0170","text":"咱回来啦～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0180","text":"呐，制作人发来的消息看到了吗？\n『采访的地点，定了吗？』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0190","text":"书店咖啡馆……游戏厅……\n都很开心呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0200","text":"…………呵呵"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0210","text":"你们俩……\n能听听我突然想到的主意吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04010000_03_0008","text":"Motion"}]
